# Data Use Agreement — AI Builder

**Dataset**: {{dataset.name}} (`{{dataset.slug}}`)
**Host**: {{host.institution}}
**Builder**: {{requester.name}} ({{requester.institution}})
**Effective**: {{generation.date}}

## 1. Purpose

This agreement governs the builder's access to the dataset for the
purpose of **developing, training, validating, or evaluating an
AI / ML model intended for commercial or product deployment**. The
output of this work is anticipated to be a **product** (a model,
service, or device), not solely a publication.

